.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH SEQ 1 "2026-09-01"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
seq \- Display numbers from FIRST to LAST, in steps of INCREMENT.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBseq\fR [OPTION]... LAST
.br
\fBseq\fR [OPTION]... FIRST LAST
.br
\fBseq\fR [OPTION]... FIRST INCREMENT LAST
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Display numbers from FIRST to LAST, in steps of INCREMENT.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-s\fR, \fB\-\-separator\fR
Separator character (defaults to \\n)
.TP
\fB\-t\fR, \fB\-\-terminator\fR
Terminator character (defaults to \\n)
.TP
\fB\-w\fR, \fB\-\-equal\-width\fR
Equalize widths of all numbers by padding with zeros
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-format\fR
use printf style floating\-point FORMAT
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
[\fInumbers\fR]

.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v(uutils coreutils) 0.11.0
